; italiano.ct - DRAFT Italian translation of locale/AmiAuth.cd.
;
; MACHINE-GENERATED FIRST PASS, NOT REVIEWED BY A NATIVE SPEAKER.
; See locale/drafts/README.md before using or building this file - it is
; not wired into any build target and must not be installed as-is.
;
; Terminology used throughout, for reviewer consistency:
;   vault      -> cassaforte     passphrase -> passphrase (kept, common IT usage)
;   account    -> account (kept, common IT tech usage) / conto avoided (bank sense)
;   issuer     -> emittente      label      -> etichetta
;   re-key     -> ricifrare / ricifratura
;   always-unlocked -> sempre sbloccato
;
##version $VER: AmiAuth.catalog 1.0 (28.07.2026)
##language italiano
##codeset 0
;
; --- CLI (src/cli/main.c) ---------------------------------------------
;
MSG_CLI_ALREADY_EXISTS
